      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nSITTING ROOM   (4.037M X 4.801M)\r\nWith laminate flooring, carpeted stairs to first floor and under stairs storage.  Open fireplace with timber and tiled surround, recessed ceiling lighting.  Door through to inner hallway.\r\n\r\nHALLWAY   (0.964M X 4.396M)\r\nWith laminate flooring and recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM   (1.743M X 2.555M)\r\nWhite suite, wc, whb and bath with shower mixer taps.  Tiled flooring and tiled around bath.  Velux window and recessed ceiling lighting.  \r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1\t(2.660M X 2.317M)\t\t\r\nWith vaulted velux window, recessed lighting and laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN/DINING ROOM   (3.580M X 4.479M)\r\nWith fully fitted kitchen incorporating appliances extractor hood, Beko electric hob and Flavel oven. With laminate\r\nflooring, recessed ceiling lighting and door through to rear garden.  Storage cupboard off kitchen.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nMAIN BEDROOM   (3.050M X 4.818M)\r\nRunning the full width from front to rear of house, with carpeted flooring and recessed ceiling lighting.\r\n\r\nEN-SUITE   (1.305M X 1.201M)\t\t\t\t\r\nWith carpeted flooring, vanity sink, wc and built in shower unit (Triton T90xr Electric Shower).  Shaver light \r\npoint an mirror over sink.  Tiled shower unit, and tiled around sink.\r\n\r\nGARDENS\r\nEnclosed, gravelled rear garden with a mix of timber fence and block wall boundaries.  \r\nBlock built Garden Shed (C. 14.5 M²).    Rear laneway, pedestrian gated rear access.\r\n\r\nSERVICES\r\nExternal Windows & Doors – uPVC double glazing.\r\nHeating – Oil Fired Central Heating System, open fireplace in Sitting Room.\r\nServices – Electricity, Water, Sewerage – general mains supply.\r\n\r\nGENERAL\r\nNo. 13 St. Michael’s Terrace is set in a row of fourteen terraced homes, just at the bottom of Abbeylands Hill,\r\nC. 170 meters from the entrance to Arklow Golf Club.  Location is second to none, close by is the Harbour,\r\nSouth Quay, South Beach and Arklow’s Lower Main Street is just a few minutes walk away.\r\nThis is a lovely home with a nice sized private west facing rear garden and would make an ideal starter home for an owner occupier or a as a buy to let investment. \r\n\r\nBER DETAILS\r\nBER Rating E, BER Number: 119727659"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "C. 70 M² 2 Bedroom & 2 Bathroom Mid Terrace House, with uPVC double glazing, OFCH, & open fireplace, on street parking and rear garden with garden shed.  Rear laneway with vehicular/pedestrian access.  Excellent location close to the Harbour, South Beach, Arklow Golf Club, and just minutes walk into Arklow town centre."
